Esses.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0},{"lap":1,"text":"The Lotus crew discovered that Clark's battery was dead, and by the time they replaced it, Broeker's Stebro, trailing the field, was already into his second lap.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":2},{"lap":7,"text":"Surtees made the first move, getting by Ginther to split the BRM's, and then, on lap seven, taking the lead from Hill.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":8},{"lap":82,"text":"On lap 82, with no threat to his lead, Surtees's engine lost power, and he cruised into the pits to retire.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":8},{"lap":110,"text":"Hill began pushing Surtees on lap 30. He got by to take the lead after shadowing for two laps, gave it back, took it again two laps later, and finally surrendered it again, settling into the Ferrari's slipstream.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0},{"lap":110,"text":"The Englishman drove under the flag 34 seconds ahead of teammate Ginther, repeating BRM's season-opening sweep at Monaco.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0}],"x":{"drivers":[{"id":448,"ref":"broeker","name":"Peter Broeker","code":null,"nationality":"Canadian","dob":"1926-05-15","helmet":null,"seasons":{"1963":{"car":"stebro_1963","source":"history","skills":{"pace":[0.0659,0.4326],"quali":[0.1038,0.3131]}}}},{"id":449,"ref":"ward","name":"Rodger Ward","code":null,"nationality":"American","dob":"1921-01-10","helmet":null,"seasons":{"1963":{"car":"team_lotus_1963","source":"history","skills":{"pace":[-0.0677,0.298],"quali":[0.0173,0.2127]}}}}],"cars":[{"id":"stebro_1963","ref":"stebro","name":"Stebro","year":1963,"pace":2.257,"pace_sd":0.5,"deg_rel":0.0,"n_races":1,"p_mech_lap":0.00744,"colours":null,"source":"history"}]}}